      "index": 2,
      "start": 11.679,
      "end": 13.669,
      "duration": 1.99,
      "text": "lag. And we're going to consider the"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.679,
      "end": 15.35,
      "duration": 1.671,
      "text": "simple problem. So first off, find a"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 15.36,
      "end": 19.189,
      "duration": 3.829,
      "text": "periodic solution to x dot dot + 8x dot"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
