      "text": "today is to give the gain and phase lag"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 34.32,
      "end": 36.79,
      "duration": 2.47,
      "text": "to this periodic solution. So I'll let"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 36.8,
      "end": 38.389,
      "duration": 1.589,
      "text": "you take a look at this problem and I'll"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 38.399,
