      "index": 24,
      "start": 81.759,
      "end": 86.31,
      "duration": 4.551,
      "text": "f e to the i omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 86.32,
      "end": 87.749,
      "duration": 1.429,
      "text": "And then at the end we're going to take"
