      "text": "output forcing or sorry to the output"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 198.239,
      "end": 200.149,
      "duration": 1.91,
      "text": "response."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 200.159,
      "end": 201.67,
      "duration": 1.511,
      "text": "And this factor is sometimes called the"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 201.68,
      "end": 206.869,
      "duration": 5.189,
      "text": "complex gain."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 209.11,
      "end": 209.12,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "And the reason it's the complex gain is"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 209.12,
      "end": 210.55,
      "duration": 1.43,
      "text": "because if we take a look at P of I"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 210.56,
      "end": 212.789,
      "duration": 2.229,
