    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": 290.32,
      "end": 293.749,
      "duration": 3.429,
      "text": "* f e i omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": 293.759,
      "end": 299.909,
      "duration": 6.15,
      "text": "So we have 7 - omega^ 2 plus 8 i omega"
