      "text": "upstairs is f e i omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": 308.629,
      "end": 308.639,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "And I'm going to just put this in"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": 308.639,
